&lt;b&gt;Comp&#233;tences&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Discr&#233;tion.html&quot; title=&quot;Discr&#233;tion&quot;&gt;Discr&#233;tion&lt;/a&gt; +18 (+28 en eaux profondes), &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Natation.html&quot; title=&quot;Natation&quot;&gt;Natation&lt;/a&gt; +43, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Perception.html&quot; title=&quot;Perception&quot;&gt;Perception&lt;/a&gt; +28 ; &lt;b&gt;Modificateurs raciaux&lt;/b&gt; +10 en Discr&#233;tion en eaux profondes
